      }
    },
    "Ensure your Mac is plugged in before starting. Do not unplug or put your Mac to sleep during the process.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始前请接通 Mac 电源。过程中不要拔掉电源，也不要让 Mac 进入睡眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ensure your workspace has adequate lighting that doesn't cause glare on your screen. Avoid working in a dark room with just the screen light.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请确保工作环境光线充足，且屏幕没有眩光。避免在黑暗房间中只靠屏幕照明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the password to extract this archive. Sapphire does not store it.": {
