    "Miss a day without breaking your streak by reporting immunity days at least 3 days in advance (unlimited). If a streak still breaks, spend a streak pass to revive it — everyone gets a few free every month by plan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "至少提前 3 天登记免打卡日，可在当天未完成目标时保住连续记录；登记次数不限。若连续记录仍中断，可使用连续记录恢复券找回。各订阅方案每月会赠送一定数量的恢复券。"
          }
