    "OpenBubbles is a free, open-source project that brings iMessage, FaceTime, and other Apple services to Android, Windows, and Linux. This tool generates a registration code using your Mac's hardware identifiers, allowing other devices to connect directly to Apple's services.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
