    "Sapphire automatically uses Apple's standard Clock shortcut names (\\\"Start Timer\\\", \\\"Start Stopwatch\\\", etc.). If iCloud sync is enabled and those Clock shortcuts are present on this Mac, they run automatically during sessions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 会自动识别 Apple 时钟的标准快捷指令名称（如“开始计时器”“开始秒表”）。如果已启用 iCloud 同步且这些快捷指令已在此 Mac 上，它们会在专注时段自动运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire is a Connect controller only, audio always plays on the Spotify desktop app or another speaker.": {
