    },
    "Temperature": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "温度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temperature Unit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "温度单位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temporarily discharge to a specific percentage. This will not affect your main charge limit or automatic discharge settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂时放电至特定百分比。这不会影响您的主要充电限制或自动放电设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temporarily remove the dim layer while Mission Control is open so you can actually see the apps in the Exposé grid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开“调度中心”时暂时移除调暗遮罩，以便查看其中的应用窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text & Editing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本与编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text Snippets": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本片段"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 20-20-20 Rule": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "20-20-20 护眼法则"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app is selected automatically. Related files stay unchecked whenever exclusive ownership cannot be proven.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用本体会自动选中。无法确认由它独占的相关文件会保持未选中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app is selected. Identifier-linked, shared, and name-based data requires review unless ownership is verified.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用本体已选中。若无法验证归属，通过标识符、共享关系或名称关联的数据需人工检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fan will be controlled automatically by macOS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "风扇将由 macOS 自动控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The green traffic-light button fills the screen without creating a new Space; clicking it again restores the window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "绿色交通灯按钮填满屏幕，而不创建新的空间；再次单击它可恢复窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper is approved but not responding. Tap Reset Helper so Sapphire can unregister its own background items and reinstall the helper.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助服务已获允许，但没有响应。点击“重置辅助服务”，让 Sapphire 重新注册后台项目并安装辅助服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper tool ensures your charging rules are still applied even if the Sapphire app isn't running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即使 Sapphire 未运行，辅助工具也会继续执行充电规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same volume, routing, EQ, 8D, surround, balance, and delay controls available in the notch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此处提供与刘海屏中相同的音量、音频路由、均衡器、8D 音效、环绕声、声道平衡和延迟控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The small expansion when hovering over the notch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "悬停在刘海屏上时的小幅膨胀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These permissions enable major features like widgets and live activities.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些权限用于启用小组件和实时活动等主要功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These permissions enable minor or cosmetic features.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些权限用于启用次要功能或外观效果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac · controls only (no audio)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac · 仅控制播放（不输出音频）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This QR code contains your Mac's unique hardware data. **Scan it with the OpenBubbles app** on your other devices to register them for iMessage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此二维码包含您 Mac 的唯一硬件数据。请在其他设备上**使用 OpenBubbles 应用扫描**，以注册 iMessage。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app was closed because it's blocked during your focus session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此应用已在专注时段被屏蔽，因此已关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This feature works best on devices with XDR displays (14in and 16in Macbook Pro's and Pro Display XDR). M4 Macbook Pro's already display this behaviour in bright environments like in direct sunlight, this feature will allow you to do it in any type of environment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此功能在配备 XDR 显示屏的设备上效果最佳，包括 14 英寸和 16 英寸 MacBook Pro，以及 Pro Display XDR。M4 MacBook Pro 在阳光直射等明亮环境下本就会提高亮度；此功能可让你在其他环境下使用相同的亮度效果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This method works for both Free and Premium users. Use at your own risk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "免费和 Premium 用户都可以使用此方法。使用风险请自行评估。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This playlist is empty.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此播放列表为空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This restores default volume, flat EQ, surround, and 8D audio for every application.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会将所有应用的音量、均衡器、环绕声和 8D 音效恢复为默认设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This reverts all connected output devices to their default state.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会将所有连接的输出设备恢复为默认状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will replace your current preferences across the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会替换应用中的现有设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Threshold": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "阈值"
          }
        }
