      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "什么是 OpenBubbles？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Spotify desktop on this Mac plays an ad, relaunch it in the background, then resume via Spotify Connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 上的 Spotify 桌面版播放广告时，在后台重新启动它，再通过 Spotify Connect 恢复播放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a Live Activity appears automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当实时活动自动出现时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When another app is playing, show a Spotify source tab so you can switch medias. Hidden while Spotify itself is the main media source.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其他应用播放媒体时显示 Spotify 来源标签，方便切换。Spotify 已是主要来源时则隐藏该标签。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, 100% app volume is capped by current system output volume.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，应用音量设为 100% 时仍受当前系统输出音量限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, your Mac will stop using AC power and run from its battery until the battery limit is reached.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，Mac 会停止使用外接电源，改由电池供电，直到达到设定电量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When re-opening the notch, it will return to the last menu you had open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新打开刘海屏时，它将返回到您上次打开的菜单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the notch is collapsed, swipe up over it to hide it completely. Swipe down near the notch area to bring it back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当刘海屏折叠时，向上滑动以将其完全隐藏。在刘海屏区域附近向下滑动可将其恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you drag a file out of the shelf, remove it from the shelf automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将文件拖出文件暂存架后，自动从暂存架移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While caffeinated, set brightness to zero when the lid reaches the trigger angle. This does not put the display to sleep.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保持唤醒期间，上盖合到设定角度时将亮度降为零，但显示器不会进入睡眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
